{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3VJyZOSx0V_ddOtx41lStQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:48.622082+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3VJyZOSx0V_ddOtx41lStQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/XhbqU4MQaicmoiaGpyEsiccN8zUmho6E67qXv8iaGialv3asd5IGbbJR3JibYno43sDlHDvWL7wMJOrHneoYTM11icibuCEC9yPFyxab0eVkz8ciaCCg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>一、中山大学大气科学学院简介</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XhbqU4MQaickOc1tRRoDWyeZvVSpNYl9xsYve7MKadKSSXCbicANXBLCPqBI128WgBo1Nibia0mP1wCIKyGqJDCoYvv63BpRiaCM60icbZtEE86ibQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人才培养</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>中山大学大气科学学院是位于珠海校区的整建制学院。</span></span></strong><span>学院成立于2015年，前身是1961年创办的中山大学地理学系气象学专业。学院目前已建立完整的“本硕博”大气科学人才培养体系，设有</span><span><strong><span>3个本科专业</span></strong></span><span>，并成功申报</span><strong><span><span>“大气科学+人工智能”双学士学位</span></span></strong><span>复合型人才培养项目；设有</span><span><strong><span>2个学术型博士点、硕士点，2个专业学位博士点、硕士点</span></strong></span><span>；现有本科生288人，硕士研究生369人，博士研究生253人。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XhbqU4MQaick5l8l5S6LDfN72dPqLyY02xvm9ywGgLlMI92qY8j0NrDIwpbB4C2VATNugicSpwfnkfK22hVpz7diaH8L6iammVzT7NqQmgXwic9s/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>近年来学院研究生招生人数稳中有增</span><span>，2021年招收硕士生99名、博士生57名；2022年招收硕士生120名、博士生60名；2023年招收硕士生117名、博士生66名；2024年招收硕士生143名、博士生67人；2025年招收硕士生122名、博士生55人。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/XhbqU4MQaiclEPyO0cMYLeYQ6NJO9uhdfrSGVNTZYlaXdPXxr1WrPA5bJf8n26e29vB9LnJiczmDia9peRMtQdHQtjNCUpJdNnqFk4xnL5Kglg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>师资队伍</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>学院积极打造一流的大气科学学科人才队伍，建成了教学与科研相融合的卓越人才培养支撑系统。</span></strong></span><span>全院教职工达196人，其中专任教师109人，包括教授48人、副教授61人、专职科研人员和博士后37人；并有中科院院士1人、“973”项目首席科学家2人、国家重点研发计划首席科学家4人、国家级高层次人才35人次、全国气象教学名师1人、广东省教学名师1人等一大批高层次人才。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XhbqU4MQaicmf8uhlbOm4vANdFiayGgVPkUlibOyNVJccj0niaibpgy3wL05ZKTPiaMuF9RRrrFYpDwfLPZePKB6tuD9TTe5c7tDoXUFRrDibW4YOQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>科研创新</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>学院以“推进科技自立自强，服务国家战略与粤港澳大湾区发展”为导向</span></strong></span><span>，围绕“陆面过程与天气、气候和环境”“气候变化、可持续发展与冰冻圈科学”“泛南海地区大气海洋系统科学”“粤港澳大湾区、南海及周边地区大气环境研究”“空间与行星科学”</span><strong><span><span>五个特色与优势方向</span></span></strong><span>，促进科研工作高质量内涵式发展。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XhbqU4MQaiclXP2fwwPW68ebIvZtzNdhepgr6BZg7dyOG5N9VOclZctD7WxGbJuiapvjwfAiclsYBjeEnaNnPGQ66tpIKzOlKu6jDSFTRqjHDs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>国际合作</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>学院积极推动对外学术交流与合作，致力于培育具有全球视野的创新型人才。</span></span></strong><span>依托“未来地球计划”全球秘书中心(中国)和“未来地球计划”中国委员会秘书处等国际化平台，聚焦东亚季风区极端天气气候变化、南海空气污染等重大环境议题，学院与30余所国际顶尖机构建立了深度合作关系。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/XhbqU4MQaicmagJ3Uj7Uu9GmNP1pibjwQBTu9q9yqjria0FMqibUHJaqicqoCHB9xXOxHNt9iakl1dUNykfH15OyyDicgT0BSeWMNicFCF9C8ocrIjo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>二、活动简介</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>为加强全国高校大气科学领域青年学子之间的交流，增进青年学生对中山大学以及大气科学学院的了解，吸引更多有志青年投身大气科学和行星科学及其相关领域，中山大学大气科学学院将于2026年7月在中山大学珠海校区举行</span><span><strong><span>“中山大学大气科学学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营”</span></strong></span><span>（以下简称“夏令营”），夏令营面向全国招收大气科学和行星科学学科以及相关学科的优秀本科生，即日起开放夏令营报名。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资格</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><ol><li><p><span>热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，政治立场坚定，遵纪守法，品德良好，学风端正，身心健康；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><span><strong><span>全国高校本科二、三年级在校生；</span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><span>本科就读于大气科学、行星科学及相关专业，包括但不限于气象学、大气物理学与化学、气候变化与环境生态、海洋科学、地球物理（含空间物理）、地理学、生态学、水文学、数学、力学、物理学、化学、计算机科学等；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><span>具有良好英语听、说、读、写能力；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><span>科研兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力。</span></p></li></ol></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>时间和地点</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><ol><li><p><strong><span>时间：</span></strong><span>2026年7月12日-7月15日</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>地点：</span></strong><span>中山大学珠海校区海琴2号（具体地点另行通知）</span></p></li></ol></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>报名方式</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><ol><li><p><strong><span>报名时间：</span></strong><span>即日起至2026年6月28日23:59</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>报名流程</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>①填写问卷：</span></strong><span>报名者完整填写并提交</span><span><strong><span>问卷</span></strong></span><span>完成报名（链接：</span><strong><span><span>https://wj.sysu.edu.cn/q/YJbDXynF</span></span></strong><span>）</span></p><p><strong><span>②提交材料：</span></strong><span>把以下申请材料1~6按顺序扫描为1个PDF文件，以“</span><span><strong><span>姓名+所在学校全称+2026中大大气夏令营</span></strong></span><span>”文件命名，于2026年6月28日前发送至邮箱</span><span><strong><span>laixj23@mail.sysu.edu.cn</span></strong></span><span>，邮件主题名称须与文件名称一致。</span></p></li></ol></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>【申请材料】</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><ol><li><p><span>中山大学大气科学学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营</span><strong><span>申请表</span></strong><span>（须</span><strong><span>加盖所在院系公章或教务章</span></strong><span>，模板请在中山大学大气科学学院官网研究生教育栏目相关通知中下载）；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>学生证</span></strong><span>（须将封面封底、个人信息页、注册页扫描在A4纸的同一面上）；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>身份证</span></strong><span>（须将正反面扫描在A4纸的同一面上）；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><span>本科现阶段</span><strong><span>成绩单及排名证明</span></strong><span>（须有高校教务部门或院系</span><strong><span>盖章</span></strong><span>）；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>荣誉获奖</span></strong><span>证明材料（如有多项，请选择3项代表性获奖证书，合成一个pdf）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>学术能力</span></strong><span>证明材料（如有多项，请选择3项代表性成果，合成一个pdf）</span></p></li></ol></section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项：申请者应对所提交的报名信息及材料的真实性、有效性、完整性负责，提交不实信息和材料者将被取消营员资格。</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>资格审定</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><ol><li><p><span>夏令营入营资格审核与选拔由中山大学大气科学学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营组委会负责。入选名单将于2026年6月底在</span><strong><span><span>中山大学大气科学学院网站研究生教育栏目</span></span></strong><span><strong><span>（https://atmos.sysu.edu.cn/Postgraduate）</span></strong></span><span>上公布，未入选者不再另行通知。</span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><span>经审核入选夏令营的同学请按照日程安排的要求按时报到和参与相关活动，因特殊情况不能参加本次活动，请于</span><span><strong><span>7月8日前</span></strong></span><span>邮件告知本次夏令营联系人。</span></p></li></ol></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>5</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动安排</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>7月12日</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学员报到</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7月13日</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营开营仪式、知名学者讲座，师生交流、学员交流、其他文化交流活动</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7月14日</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>知名学者讲座、师生交流、学员交流</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>7月15日</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>知名学者讲座，师生交流、学员交流，结营离校</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><strong><span>（注：本安排为拟定计划，具体安排以正式活动为准）</span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>6</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>其他事宜</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><ol><li><p><span>本次夏令营免费提供在营期间的住宿、早午晚餐（不含提前到达或延后离开部分），所有营员住宿为2人/间，男女生分开，可自行组合（开营前收集），如未组合，由组委会安排。营员参加夏令营的往返交通以及其他费用等一律自理。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><span>夏令营期间，营员应遵守夏令营安排，按时参加各项活动，遵守中山大学大气科学学院的有关规章制度和夏令营纪律要求。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><span>夏令营期间，学生安全由本人及学籍所在学校负责，夏令营将统一为学生购买人身意外伤害保险。学生须在出发前打印签署安全责任告知书（提交电子版和纸质版，提交方式另行通知）。</span></p></li></ol></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人：</span></strong><span>赖老师</span></p><p><strong><span>联系电话：</span></strong><span>0756-3668863</span></p><p><strong><span>通讯地址：</span></strong><span>广东省珠海市香洲区唐家湾中山大学珠海校区海琴二号A392</span></p><p><strong><span>电子邮箱：</span></strong><span>laixj23@mail.sysu.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>---ATMOS---</span></p><p><span>来源 | 赖晓杰</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 程子璇</span></p><p><span>初审 | 赖晓杰</span></p><p><span>审核 | 袁乃明、游顺勇</span></p><p><span>审核发布 | 郑慧</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>欢迎投稿</span></p><p><span>mediaofsas@163.com</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/XhbqU4MQaicnOk4jLS9GZM1tyEUPCAVZPP6tTXbicugXpgx1dHEibJ2aLDedxDVcJEjJHsqXYA8paT4d4Hq5x9tweoT7EYgc2TNv4wJ1ayzsaE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"733b93b4307c26751897dc4cb8c49c73558e50612303120fe08a8c05de5edbdd","textLength":2461,"sourceSha256":"df9f4ec37031e42ac67811da104733997f9b36cce7da1d205a1d62f3db155650","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ef71ed25289512c615c8","title":"2026年中山大学大气科学学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:48.622082+00:00"}
